# Naming Conventions

| Entity | Convention | Example |
|--------|-----------|---------|
| Files (components) | kebab-case | project-card.tsx |
| Files (hooks) | use-kebab-case | use-current-user.ts |
| Components | PascalCase | ProjectCard |
| Props types | PascalCase + Props | ProjectCardProps |
| Hooks | camelCase with use | useCurrentUser |
| Utility functions | camelCase | formatDate |
| Constants | UPPER_SNAKE_CASE | MAX_FREE_PROJECTS |
| Env vars | UPPER_SNAKE_CASE | DATABASE_URL |
| DB tables | snake_case plural | yearly_plans |
| API routes | kebab-case paths | /api/check-ins/weekly |
| Zod schemas | camelCase + Schema | createProjectSchema |
| TypeScript types | PascalCase | ProjectWithTasks |
| CSS variables | kebab-case | --color-primary |
| Route groups | (lowercase) | (marketing), (auth), (app) |

## PARA Terminology (Phase 2+)

We renamed the core domain to align with the Second-Brain / PARA model. Always use the new names in new code:

| Old name | New name | Notes |
|----------|----------|-------|
| Goal | **Project** | `db.project`, table still `goals` via `@@map` |
| Action | **Task** | `db.task`, table still `actions` via `@@map` |
| DailySystem | **System** | `db.system`, table still `daily_systems` |
| GoalCheckIn | **ProjectCheckIn** | table still `goal_check_ins` |
| CheckpointGoal | **ProjectCheckpoint** | table still `checkpoint_goals` |
| (new) | **Area** | PARA life-domain anchor; six default areas seeded per user |
| (new) | **Vision** / **VisionItem** | Life-spanning vision board (1:1 to User) |
| (new) | **Note** / **Resource** | Polymorphic — attach to any PARA entity |
| (new) | **Drift** | Quick-capture inbox row |
| (new) | **DailyState** | Per-day mood / energy / intention / reflection |

URL path params still use legacy keys where the dynamic segment is `[goalId]` etc.; only rename the segment when the page itself is moved (Phase 7).
